-- TYPE MISMATCH ---------- errors/type_mismatch_22.march

expected `Int` but got `String`. [type_mismatch]

5 |     n + s
            ^

    This is the right side of `+`, and both sides of `+` must have the same type.

    the expected type comes from here:

5 |     n + s
        ^

    `s` was bound here as `String`:

4 |     let s = "hello"
            ^
    run `march --explain type_mismatch`


